## Title: Addon Loadouts
## Description: Save and load addon enable/disable presets (loadouts) per server. Use the settings menu to manage loadouts and the radial wheel to apply one quickly.
## Author: @dack_janiels[PC]
## APIVersion: 101049 101050 
## Version: 1.5
## AddOnVersion: 1
## SavedVariables: AddonLoadoutsSavedVars
## DependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20103 LibRadialMenu>=7

# Language Files
lang/default.lua
lang/$(language).lua

# Do the stuff.
AddonLoadouts.lua

